{
  "type": "judge-assert",
  "title": "Digit Distance",
  "stars": 2,
  "hints": [
    "最右边的数位是 n % 10,它左边那位是 (n / 10) % 10。",
    "只剩一位数时距离为 0——这就是递归的边界。"
  ],
  "tests": [
    "digit_distance(6) == 0",
    "digit_distance(61) == 5",
    "digit_distance(567) == 2",
    "digit_distance(71253) == 12"
  ]
}
